PN,37201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,FThe police marksman who shot Chris
OL,7,FKaba will not face disciplinary
OL,8,Fproceedings, a watchdog has confirmed.
OL,10,FMartyn Blake, also known by the cypher
OL,11,FNX121, was cleared of murder after an
OL,12,FOld Bailey trial, but was due to face
OL,13,Fdisciplinary proceedings.
OL,15,FHowever, after the Government changed
OL,16,Fregulations around police use of
OL,17,Fforce, watchdog the Independent Office
OL,18,Ffor Police Conduct said this will now
OL,19,Fno longer take place.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,FFigures in policing welcomed the
OL,7,Fdecision, while campaigners said they
OL,8,Fare appalled and called the move "a
OL,9,Fdevastating blow".
OL,11,FIOPC director of engagement Amanda
OL,12,FRowe said: "Our thoughts remain with
OL,13,FChris Kaba's family and friends and
OL,14,Feveryone impacted by his death.
OL,26,@pD@bOUqD@QO]tD@LOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,F"We are acutely aware of the impact of
OL,7,Fproceedings for everyone involved in
OL,8,Fthis case and have always sought to
OL,9,Favoid any unnecessary delays, however
OL,10,Fit was right that we paused
OL,11,Fprogressing disciplinary proceedings
OL,12,Funtil the legislation change came into
OL,13,Feffect and its impact was clear.
OL,15,F"Having considered both our policy and
OL,16,Fthe representations from the Kaba
OL,17,Ffamily and Sergeant Blake, we have
OL,18,Ftoday notified them of our decision to
OL,19,Fwithdraw disciplinary proceedings."
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOU{D@cO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,FA coroner will now decide whether an
OL,7,Finquest will take place into Mr Kaba's
OL,8,Fdeath.
OL,10,FPaula Dodds, chairwoman of the
OL,11,FMetropolitan Police Federation, said:
OL,12,F"This is very much the right decision
OL,13,Fthat will not only be welcomed by the
OL,14,Fofficer and his family, but all police
OL,15,Fofficers across London.
OL,26,@tD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,F"It is imperative that there are
OL,7,Fpolicies in place for operational
OL,8,Fpolicing which support lawful
OL,9,Fdecisions made by officers, based on
OL,10,Ftheir training, so that they should
OL,11,Fnot be placed in fear of the loss of
OL,12,Ftheir liberty and livelihood.
OL,14,F"Police officers are of course ` and
OL,15,Frightly ` highly accountable for their
OL,16,Factions. But the officer has sadly
OL,17,Fsuffered years of legal scrutiny
OL,18,Ffollowing this incident.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,F"We are pleased this has all now
OL,7,Fconcluded and that the officer can
OL,8,Fcontinue to serve the public without
OL,9,Fthis hanging over him.
OL,11,F"We thank his legal team for their
OL,12,Fyears of hard work on this case."
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUtD@aO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,FCommissioner Sir Mark Rowley also
OL,7,Fwelcomed the decision, saying:
OL,8,F"Today's decision finally brings to an
OL,9,Fend almost four years of uncertainty
OL,10,Ffor NX121, his family and the wider
OL,11,Ffirearms command, with all the
OL,12,Fconsiderable worry and stress that has
OL,13,Fbrought.
OL,15,F"We also recognise the profound impact
OL,16,Fon Chris Kaba's family, who continue
OL,17,Fto grieve their loss."
OL,26,@pD@AOUwD@AOUyD@VO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,FHe said the IOPC's decision should be
OL,7,F"a milestone moment to reset a police
OL,8,Faccountability system that is out of
OL,9,Fbalance".
OL,11,FHe added: "No police officer is above
OL,12,Fthe law, but we have been clear the
OL,13,Fsystem holding police to account is
OL,14,Fbroken.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@HO]sD@KOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,F"I worry about the lack of support
OL,7,Fofficers face for doing their best,
OL,8,Fbut most of all I worry for the
OL,9,Fpublic. As I have said before, the
OL,10,Fmore we crush the spirit of good
OL,11,Fofficers, the less they can fight
OL,12,Fcrime."
OL,14,FAfter Sgt Blake's acquittal, then-home
OL,15,Fsecretary Yvette Cooper vowed to
OL,16,Fchange laws around use of force for
OL,17,Fpolice officers, and as a result the
OL,18,Ftest used by the IOPC over whether to
OL,19,Fbring misconduct proceedings has been
OL,20,Fraised to the level used in criminal
OL,21,Flaw.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@GO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
