OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,FSgt Blake shot the 24-year-old in
OL,7,FStreatham, south-east London, in 2022
OL,8,Fafter he tried to ram his way past
OL,9,Fpolice cars.
OL,11,FOn the night Mr Kaba died, police had
OL,12,Ffollowed and penned in the Audi he was
OL,13,Fdriving because it had been linked to
OL,14,Fthree previous firearms incidents in
OL,15,Ffive months.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,FThey were not aware of his identity at
OL,7,Fthe time, but Mr Kaba was a member of
OL,8,Fone of London's most violent street
OL,9,Fgangs and was accused of being
OL,10,Finvolved in two shootings in the six
OL,11,Fdays before he died.
OL,13,FTemi Mwale, from the Justice for Chris
OL,14,FKaba Campaign, said: "We are appalled
OL,15,Fby the IOPC's decision to abandon
OL,16,Fdisciplinary proceedings against
OL,17,FMartyn Blake.
OL,26,@vD@VOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G11/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,F"This is a devastating blow ` not just
OL,7,Fto Chris Kaba's family, but to
OL,8,Feveryone who cares about living in a
OL,9,Fsociety where the police are not above
OL,10,Fthe law.
OL,12,F"The extraordinary treatment of Martyn
OL,13,FBlake throughout this case sends a
OL,14,Fdangerous message: when police kill,
OL,15,Fthe system will bend over backwards to
OL,16,Fprotect police officers rather than
OL,17,Fhold them accountable and deliver
OL,18,Fjustice.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G12/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,F"The IOPC had a choice. Today it chose
OL,7,Fnot to do the right thing. That
OL,8,Fdecision is deeply damaging to public
OL,9,Fconfidence in its independence and its
OL,10,Fwillingness to hold police officers to
OL,11,Faccount."
OL,13,FDeborah Coles, director of the charity
OL,14,FInquest, said: "It is clear from our
OL,15,Fwork that when police kill, they
OL,16,Fremain above the law.
OL,18,F"The IOPC's capitulation to firearms
OL,19,Fofficers demonstrates a troubling
OL,20,Freluctance to provide fearless and
OL,21,Findependent oversight.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@IO]vD@POUzD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G13/14
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37214
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1785946757
OL,3,CNo disciplinary proceedings against
OL,4,Cpolice officer who shot Chris Kaba
OL,6,F"This is a blow to the family and a
OL,7,Fchilling reminder of the serious and
OL,8,Fdangerous erosion of police
OL,9,Faccountability. It sends a message
OL,10,Fthat police can act with impunity."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@cO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G14/14
